 StandardForm_WithButtons;parms;n;globalParms
⍝ Presents a standard form with a status bar and three buttons, "OK", "Help" and "Close"
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'MyForm'
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.minSize←100 200
 parms.hasStatusbar←1
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.AddButtons n('OK' 'Help' 'Cancel')
 #.⎕SHADOW'OnSelect'
 #.APLGUI.OnSelect←{⎕←((0⊃⍵).Caption),' was pressed' ⋄ n←APLGUI.APLGuiUtils.GetRefTo_n 0⊃⍵ ⋄ n.∆CloseForm}
 n.∆buttons.onSelect←⊂'#.APLGUI.OnSelect'
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃##.APLGUI.Version

 n.∆Form.Wait
 n.∆CloseForm
 #.APLGUI.⎕EX'OnSelect'
⍝Done
